            <p>
              Hello! My name is Ali Haider, accountant by qualification and a
              self-taught software developer by passion. I enjoy creating
              software for both fun and living.
            </p>
            <p>
              My interest in programming peaked back in 2017 when I casually
              decided to continue an abandoned open source android app. I went
              in blindfolded. It was overwhelming, but it helped me learn a lot.
            </p>
            <p>
              Who could’ve thought that a decision taken on a whim would help me
              find my passion?
            </p>
            <p>
              Currently, I have been focused on Full Stack aspect of software
              development with a little bit of Rust & C on the side.
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- <img class="about-img" href="" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/picsum/300/300"></img> -->
        </div>
